{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torch of Shadows is a fast-paced roguelite where you fight to preserve the balance between Light and Dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last guardian of an ancient temple, a place that seals a black hole capable of consuming all existence. If the temple falls, both light and darkness will be erased\u2014only the void will remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/7846afc90fa5edf362e2adcfc0fc6068.poster.avif?t=1757963295\" aria-label=\"character forms\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/7846afc90fa5edf362e2adcfc0fc6068.webm?t=1757963295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf13 A Battle of Balance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies attack in waves, alternating between Light and Dark forms. To survive, you must counter them with the opposite force:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Light attacks to banish Dark creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Dark attacks to strike down Light creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike converts the battlefield with the energy of your attack, shifting territory control between Light and Dark. The balance is always fragile, and it is up to you to maintain it. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Light vs Dark combat \u2013 counter enemies with opposing powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression \u2013 unlock permanent upgrades and experiment with new builds each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving battlefield \u2013 the ground itself shifts forms based on your attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies and bosses \u2013 face unique threats that change as time passes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability \u2013 every run offers new choices, upgrades, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/c44887e866fe6c778f874192d8e9a054.avif?t=1757963295\" alt=\"Fight scene\" width=1348 height=756 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007420?t=1757963295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007420?t=1757963295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/e06befc781aa5ba449bd9043b2f906a2a47f143d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757963295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/e06befc781aa5ba449bd9043b2f906a2a47f143d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757963295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torch of Shadows is a fast-paced roguelite where you fight to preserve the balance between Light and Dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last guardian of an ancient temple, a place that seals a black hole capable of consuming all existence. If the temple falls, both light and darkness will be erased\u2014only the void will remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/7846afc90fa5edf362e2adcfc0fc6068.poster.avif?t=1757963295\" aria-label=\"character forms\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/7846afc90fa5edf362e2adcfc0fc6068.webm?t=1757963295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf13 A Battle of Balance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies attack in waves, alternating between Light and Dark forms. To survive, you must counter them with the opposite force:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Light attacks to banish Dark creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Dark attacks to strike down Light creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike converts the battlefield with the energy of your attack, shifting territory control between Light and Dark. The balance is always fragile, and it is up to you to maintain it. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Light vs Dark combat \u2013 counter enemies with opposing powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression \u2013 unlock permanent upgrades and experiment with new builds each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving battlefield \u2013 the ground itself shifts forms based on your attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies and bosses \u2013 face unique threats that change as time passes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability \u2013 every run offers new choices, upgrades, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/c44887e866fe6c778f874192d8e9a054.avif?t=1757963295\" alt=\"Fight scene\" width=1348 height=756 /></span></p>","developers":["Acthera Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}]